# EAS CLI uses the Git repository root ignore file in a monorepo.
# Keep the protections below in sync with .gitignore.
# 本目录当前不是公开仓库；忽略规则不是脱敏或审计的替代品。
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/ios/
**/android/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
**/*.jks
**/*.mobileprovision
.DS_Store

# 内部权利证据和未经放行的构建候选不得随源码发布。
**/*.private.csv
**/*.private.json
**/*.private.md
**/*.private/
/distributions/admin/candidate-not-release/
/distributions/admin/candidate-not-release.*

# Do not upload unrelated workspaces, private artifacts, or local credentials.
.git/
/apps/telegram-bot/
/distributions/
/releases/
**/.npmrc
**/credentials.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json
**/*.pfx

# Python validation caches are local only.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
